### Auth API — uji manual (VS Code REST Client)
### Cookie disimpan otomatis oleh REST Client antar request.
### Jalankan: npm run dev  (dan `npm run seed` sekali untuk membuat akun dummy)
###
### Akun dummy hasil `npm run seed` (password semuanya: rahasia123)
###   sales@ab-medical.local     role: sales
###   manager@ab-medical.local   role: sales_manager
###   director@ab-medical.local  role: director

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = sales@ab-medical.local
@password = rahasia123
@foreignOrigin = http://evil.example

### ============================================================
### Autentikasi
### ============================================================

### 1. Login — harus 200, Set-Cookie berisi access_token + refresh_token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Profil user aktif — harus 200, tanpa password_hash
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 3. Rotasi token — harus 200 dan nilai kedua cookie berubah
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh

### 4. Logout — harus 200 dan kedua cookie terhapus
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

### 5. /me setelah logout — harus 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 6. Password salah — harus 401 "Email atau password salah."
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "password-salah"
}

### 7. Email tidak terdaftar — pesan & waktu respons harus sama dengan #6
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tidak.ada@ab-medical.local",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 8. Body tidak valid — harus 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bukan-email",
  "password": ""
}

### ============================================================
### Rate limit & CSRF
### ============================================================

### 9. Jalankan request ini 11x berturut-turut — ke-11 harus 429
#    "Terlalu banyak percobaan. Coba lagi nanti."
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "pemicu-rate-limit"
}

### 10. Origin asing pada request mutasi — harus 403 "Origin tidak diizinkan."
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{foreignOrigin}}

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 11. GET dengan Origin asing — harus tetap 200 (bukan mutasi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Origin: {{foreignOrigin}}

### ============================================================
### Modul users — hashing password
### ============================================================

### 12. Buat user — harus 201, response TIDAK memuat password_hash/password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Sales Contoh",
  "role": "sales",
  "email": "sales.contoh@ab-medical.local",
  "no_telp": "081234567890",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 13. Daftar user — tidak boleh ada password_hash di mana pun
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### 14. Ganti password — setelah ini password lama harus 401, password baru 200
###     Ganti {{id_user}} dengan id dari respons #12, atau pakai akun seed.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id_user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "password-baru-456"
}
